  "question": {
    "text": "Extraction of a metal ( $M$ ) from its sulfide ore $\\left(M_{2} S\\right)$ involves the following chemical reactions:\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n2 \\mathrm{M}_{2} \\mathrm{~S}+3 \\mathrm{O}_{2} \\stackrel{\\text { heat }}{\\longrightarrow} 2 \\mathrm{M}_{2} \\mathrm{O}+2 \\mathrm{SO}_{2} \\uparrow \\\\\r\n\\mathrm{M}_{2} \\mathrm{~S}+2 \\mathrm{M}_{2} \\mathrm{O} \\stackrel{\\text { heat }}{\\longrightarrow} 6 \\mathrm{M}+\\mathrm{SO}_{2} \\uparrow\r\n\\end{array}$\r\nThe metal (M) may be",
    "image": null
